Feature: Calculator Postfix API

  Background:
    Given   I am a user of Calculator API
    And     I am using postfix notation

  Scenario: I can sum two numbers
    When    I send 3 4 +
    Then    I obtain status 200
    And     I obtain body 7 
    
  Scenario: I can sum any number of numbers
    When    I send 3 4 5 6 7 ++ 2 3 4 ++
    Then    I obtain status 200
    And     I obtain body 34 
    
  @multiplication @skip
  Scenario: I can multiply two numbers
    When    I send 3 4 *
    Then    I obtain status 200
    And     I obtain body 12

